{"entities":"[{\"text\": \"Downbeat nystagmus\", \"id\": \"D009759\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"morphine\", \"id\": \"D009020\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"dizziness\", \"id\": \"D004244\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"downbeating nystagmus\", \"id\": \"D009759\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"morphine\", \"id\": \"D009020\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"morphine\", \"id\": \"D009020\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"morphine\", \"id\": \"D009020\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}]","filtered_entities":[{"text":"Downbeat nystagmus","id":"D009759","label":"Disease"},{"text":"morphine","id":"D009020","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"dizziness","id":"D004244","label":"Disease"},{"text":"downbeating nystagmus","id":"D009759","label":"Disease"}],"head":"morphine","head_id":"D009020","pairs":[{"head":"morphine","tail":"Downbeat nystagmus","head_id":"D009020","tail_id":"D009759"},{"head":"morphine","tail":"dizziness","head_id":"D009020","tail_id":"D004244"}],"relations":["D009020 | D004244"],"result":"$","tail":"dizziness","tail_id":"D004244","text":"Downbeat nystagmus associated with intravenous patient-controlled administration of morphine. IMPLICATIONS: This case documents a patient who developed dizziness with downbeating nystagmus while receiving a relatively large dose of IV patient-controlled analgesia morphine. Although there have been case reports of epidural morphine with these symptoms and signs, this has not been previously documented with IV or patient-controlled analgesia morphine.","metrics":{"precision":1.0,"recall":0.5,"f1":0.6666666666666666,"rel_tp":1,"rel_fp":0,"rel_fn":1}}